{"id":"en_trash-my-gatling-says-no","title":"Trash? My Gatling Says No!","titleEn":"Trash? My Gatling Says No!","description":"A man is transported to another world where people awaken professions, but the one he receives is of an unknown level, and those around him dismiss it as worthless. He alone understands the truth: his profession is actually triple-S rank. Armed with that secret, he sets out to prove his worth through repeated demonstrations of his strength. Along the way, he crosses paths with two sisters, and what develops between them remains an open question.","poster":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/trash-my-gatling-says-no/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn1.nsstorage.space/trash-my-gatling-says-no/en_US/a07426ca32bd65ac/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Chinese Fantasy","Counterattack","Life OL","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difkw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_trash-my-gatling-says-no_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difkw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trash-my-gatling-says-no_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difkw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trash-my-gatling-says-no_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difkw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trash-my-gatling-says-no_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7difkw/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_trash-my-gatling-